{'symbol': 'GRMN', 'date': '2022-06-09 07:00:00', 'title': "PURPOSE-BUILT FOR PROFESSIONAL TRUCK DRIVERS, GARMIN'S NEW DĒZL HEADSETS OFFER HIGH-QUALITY AUDIO AND UP TO 50 HOURS OF CONTINUOUS TALK TIME", 'text': 'OLATHE, KAN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GARMIN® INTERNATIONAL INC., A UNIT OF GARMIN LTD. (NYSE: GRMN), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE NEW DĒZL™ HEADSET 100/200 SERIES – PREMIUM OVER-THE-ROAD TRUCKING HEADSETS ENGINEERED FOR AUDIO EXCELLENCE IN NOISY CAB ENVIRONMENTS. WHETHER ON-DUTY OR AT A REST STOP, DRIVERS CAN BENEFIT FROM THESE WIRELESS HEADSETS WHICH PROVIDE CRYSTAL CLEAR AUDIO AND ACTIVE NOISE CANCELATION (ANC) TECHNOLOGY – FUSED IN THE ADJUSTABLE BOOM MIC AND EAR CUPS – TO ENHANCE PHONE CALLS AND STREAMING'}